      "dimensions": "Image: 31.2 x 40.6 cm (12 5/16 x 16 in.); Overall: 36.5 x 49.9 cm (14 3/8 x 19 5/8 in.)",
      "movement_zh": "吴门画派",
      "tags": [
        "山水",
