      "dimensions": "Framed: 67.5 x 45.5 x 6 cm (26 9/16 x 17 15/16 x 2 3/8 in.); Unframed: 51.7 x 31.7 cm (20 3/8 x 12 1/2 in.)",
      "movement_zh": "巴洛克",
      "tags": [
        "宗教题材",
